"<p>Quick guide to the tabs on this page -- reviewing and updating contract-related changes.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Contract Checks</b> -- the working checklist for contract changes (Ingram order changes right now). Tick off each step (Contract, M365 OK, TC ELITE, TC ESS, OTHERS, DONE) as you confirm it -- this is the one tab here that actually writes/tracks who's reviewed what.</li>\n<li><b>Check Client</b> -- a combined, read-only lookup of Orders, Subscriptions, and Contract Services for one client, so you don't need to visit three separate pages.</li>\n<li><b>Contract Services</b> -- pick a month (optionally filter by client/service name) to see active contract service/bundle items billed that month.</li>\n<li><b>Ingram Subscriptions</b> -- search by client and/or subscription name to see active/pending Ingram Micro licensing.</li>\n<li><b>Ingram Orders</b> -- pick a date to see Ingram Micro orders placed since then.</li>\n</ul>"